[49m[38;5;10m+      1[0m:[38;5;10m[49m //! Differential tests: C `.so` vs Rust `.so`, both loaded with `libloading`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      2[0m:[38;5;10m[49m //!
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      3[0m:[38;5;10m[49m //! Nothing in here calls the Rust translation directly. Both implementations
