[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    175[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    176[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // Deterministic PRNG (SplitMix64) — fixed seed for reproducibility.
