[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    206[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // The differential comparison itself.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    207[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    208[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    209[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// Feed `values` to both libraries (batched, one capture each) and require the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    210[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// resulting byte streams to be identical. On mismatch, re-run value by value
